@startuml
!include style.iuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
class Notebook {
  id : Identifier
  name : String
}
class Record {
  id : Identifier
  title : String
  revision : Integer
}
class InteractionSession
class Source
class SourceVersion
class EventVersion
class Goal
class Tag {
  namespace : String
  kind : String
  canonicalKey : String
}
class TagAlias {
  normalizedAlias : String
}
class TagAssignment {
  origin : manual | agent | rule
  status : pending | active | rejected | retracted
  confidence : Number?
  revision : Integer
  targetRevision : Integer?
  algorithmId : Identifier?
}
class TagAssignmentInput {
  sourceSpan : StructuredData
}
Notebook "0..1" -- "0..*" Record : 浅层归属
Record "1" -- "0..*" InteractionSession
Record "1" -- "0..*" Source : 原材料归属
Source "1" *-- "1..*" SourceVersion
Record "0..*" -left- "0..*" SourceVersion : 正文与材料
Record "0..*" -- "0..*" EventVersion : 实际经历
Record "1" -- "0..*" Goal : 事项目标
Tag "1" *-- "0..*" TagAlias
Tag "1" -- "0..*" TagAssignment
Record "0..1" -- "0..*" TagAssignment : 记录目标
EventVersion "0..1" -right- "0..*" TagAssignment : 事件目标
TagAssignment "1" *-- "0..*" TagAssignmentInput
SourceVersion "0..1" -down- "0..*" TagAssignmentInput : 原话依据
EventVersion "0..1" -down- "0..*" TagAssignmentInput : 结构依据
note bottom of TagAssignment
每个关联的目标为记录或精确事件版本，二选一。
每项输入固定来源版本或事件版本，二选一。
自动标签保存依据；人工排除对稳定目标持续生效。
标签用于组织检索，事实、偏好与授权分别校验。
end note
@enduml
